startToolEditor: copy the saved Workbench definition or reuse the browser draft; render title, ordered tools, selected properties and toolbar preview.
select/add/move/remove tool: validate current inputs, modify selection or definition, preserve ordering and show unsaved state.
renderToolTarget: suggest registered receivers and their methods; edit typed arguments; match argument count/names to method metadata or selector arity.
preview: clicking a toolbar preview selects its definition without executing it.
toggleToolEditor: convert visual draft to JSON or validate JSON and rebuild visual controls; preserve unknown properties.
visualWorkbenchSource: validate current inputs and serialize the selected editing mode for an ordinary definition: send.
closeToolEditor: retain visual and raw drafts while dismissing the editor.
